Description:
Highway is a C++ library for SIMD (Single Instruction, Multiple Data), i.e. applying the same operation to 'lanes'. This library is a dependency from libjxl to use SIMD instructions across multiple target platforms and runtime CPUs.

Local Modifications:
Source snapshot: V8 14.4.258.49-custom at
e368b713b918f6a5ad0cf6db46c4a72c2f375b32. Only the GN source set and its
recursive header dependency closure are vendored; tests and examples are omitted.
Library source contents are unchanged. Revision matches that V8 DEPS pin rather
than the stale revision in its inherited README.chromium.
